---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Scripts from '../components/Scripts.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Gabriel Rabelo | Serviços pra Empresas"
    description="Site institucional, automação ou consultoria em IA pra sua empresa. Diagnóstico direto, prazo fechado, sem jargão técnico."
>
    <Navigation basePath="/" />

    <section id="topo" class="relative pt-40 pb-20 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
            <div class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-accent-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] animate-pulse-slow"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-4xl relative z-10 text-center">
            <span class="text-accent-primary font-bold tracking-wider text-sm uppercase mb-4 block">Para Empresas</span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
                Site, Automação ou <span class="text-gradient-accent">IA</span> pra Sua Empresa
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
                Menos tempo perdido em tarefa manual, mais margem no fim do mês. Sem jargão técnico, sem enrolação.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ofertas" class="py-16 md:py-24 relative">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="group glass-card p-10 rounded-[32px] relative overflow-hidden reveal">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-primary to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>

                    <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-primary/20 to-transparent flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)]">
                        <i data-lucide="code-2" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-primary group-hover:animate-pulse"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Site ou Sistema pra Empresa</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-primary mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">Sites, Sistemas Internos & E-commerce</p>

                    <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8 text-sm">
                        Seu site atual não vende ou seu sistema interno trava a operação? Eu resolvo: do primeiro protótipo até estar no ar.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-primary"></i> Site que carrega rápido
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-primary"></i> Sistema sob medida
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-primary"></i> Sem dor de cabeça de manutenção
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="#contato" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-sm font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group-hover:bg-accent-primary group-hover:border-accent-primary transition-all">
                        Pedir Orçamento <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="group glass-card p-10 rounded-[32px] relative overflow-hidden reveal border-2 border-accent-secondary/20" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-secondary to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>

                    <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-secondary/20 to-transparent flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(139,92,246,0.2)]">
                        <i data-lucide="brain-circuit" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-secondary group-hover:animate-pulse"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Onde a IA Economiza Seu Tempo</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-secondary mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">Diagnóstico & Implementação</p>

                    <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8 text-sm">
                        Entro na empresa, vejo onde IA resolve de verdade (e onde é só modismo caro) e implemento. ROI antes de qualquer venda.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-secondary"></i> Diagnóstico sem custo inicial
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-secondary"></i> Implementação com prazo fechado
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-secondary"></i> Sem assinatura eterna de ferramenta parada
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="#contato" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-sm font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group-hover:bg-accent-secondary group-hover:border-accent-secondary transition-all">
                        Solicitar Diagnóstico <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="group glass-card p-10 rounded-[32px] relative overflow-hidden reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-tertiary to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>

                    <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-tertiary/20 to-transparent flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(6,182,212,0.2)]">
                        <i data-lucide="workflow" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-tertiary group-hover:animate-pulse"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Tarefa Repetitiva Rodando Sozinha</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-tertiary mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">N8N, WhatsApp & Integrações</p>

                    <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8 text-sm">
                        Atendimento no WhatsApp, planilha que se atualiza sozinha, lead que cai direto no CRM. Menos gente fazendo trabalho de robô.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-tertiary"></i> Atendimento automático 24h
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-tertiary"></i> Menos erro manual
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-tertiary"></i> Time focado no que gera receita
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="#contato" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-sm font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group-hover:bg-accent-tertiary group-hover:border-accent-tertiary transition-all">
                        Ver Como Funciona <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="como-funciona" class="py-16 md:py-32 relative overflow-hidden bg-bg-surface border-y border-white/5">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-5xl">
            <div class="mb-24 reveal text-center">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Como Funciona</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">Sem burocracia, sem enrolação. Só as etapas que realmente importam.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[19px] md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-[2px] bg-gradient-to-b from-accent-primary via-accent-tertiary to-transparent md:-translate-x-1/2"></div>
                <div class="absolute left-[18px] md:left-1/2 top-0 h-1/3 w-[4px] bg-accent-glow blur-sm md:-translate-x-1/2 animate-pulse"></div>

                <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-0 mb-24 group reveal">
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-16 md:text-right order-2 md:order-1 pl-12 md:pl-0">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors">Diagnóstico</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary text-base">Entendo o que você precisa e por quê, não só o que foi pedido. Alinhamos escopo e expectativa antes da primeira linha de código.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bg-main border-2 border-accent-primary z-10 md:-translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)] order-1 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-primary rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute -top-10 left-12 md:left-auto md:right-1/2 md:mr-20 text-[140px] font-bold text-white/5 pointer-events-none select-none leading-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">01</div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-16 order-3 hidden md:block"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-0 mb-24 group reveal">
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-16 hidden md:block"></div>
                    <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bg-main border-2 border-accent-secondary z-10 md:-translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(139,92,246,0.5)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-secondary rounded-full"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-16 order-2 pl-12 md:pl-16">
                        <div class="absolute -top-10 left-12 md:left-auto md:ml-4 text-[140px] font-bold text-white/5 pointer-events-none select-none leading-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">02</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-accent-secondary transition-colors">Proposta e Prazo</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary text-base">Escopo fechado, prazo fechado, investimento fechado. Sem letra miúda pra descobrir depois.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-0 group reveal">
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-16 md:text-right order-2 md:order-1 pl-12 md:pl-0">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-accent-tertiary transition-colors">Entrega</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary text-base">Escrevo o código, testo de verdade e entrego algo pronto pra produção, não só pra demo.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bg-main border-2 border-accent-tertiary z-10 md:-translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.5)] order-1 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-tertiary rounded-full"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute -top-10 left-12 md:left-auto md:right-1/2 md:mr-20 text-[140px] font-bold text-white/5 pointer-events-none select-none leading-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">03</div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-16 order-3 hidden md:block"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-3xl text-center">
            <p class="text-text-muted">
                Buscando alguém pra uma vaga sênior? <a href="/#cases" class="text-accent-primary hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors">Veja meus sistemas de IA em produção</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contato" class="py-16 md:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-radial from-accent-primary/10 to-bg-main z-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="max-w-2xl w-full glass-card p-8 md:p-14 rounded-[40px] border border-white/10 shadow-2xl reveal relative overflow-hidden">

                <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1/2 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-primary to-transparent opacity-50 blur-sm"></div>

                <div class="text-center mb-10">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Vamos Resolver Isso?</h2>
                    <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg">Me conta o problema. Eu digo se dá pra resolver, o prazo e o investimento.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=5511921586783" target="_blank" class="w-full py-5 glass-card rounded-xl text-white font-medium text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-white/20 hover:border-accent-success group">
                        <i data-lucide="phone" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-success"></i>
                        <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">WhatsApp</span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="mailto:gabrielrabelob@gmail.com" class="w-full py-5 glass-card rounded-xl text-white font-medium text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-white/20 hover:border-accent-secondary group">
                        <i data-lucide="mail" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-secondary"></i>
                        <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">E-mail</span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gabrielrabelob/" target="_blank" class="w-full py-5 glass-card rounded-xl text-white font-medium text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-white/20 hover:border-accent-primary group">
                        <i data-lucide="linkedin" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary"></i>
                        <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">LinkedIn</span>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-6 md:gap-12">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-text-muted text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-success"></i> Resposta Rápida
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-text-muted text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="coffee" class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-success"></i> Orçamento Sem Compromisso
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <Footer basePath="/" />
    <Scripts />
</BaseLayout>
